"1","Manners, Righteousness and Maintaining Good Relations","الآداب والبر والصلة","Manners, Righteousness and Maintaining Good Relations","Manners, Righteousness and Maintaining Good Relations","Manners, Righteousness and Maintaining Good Relations","Manners, Righteousness and Maintaining Good Relations","Manners, Righteousness and Maintaining Good Relations","Manners, Righteousness and Maintaining Good Relations","اخلاق، نیکی اور صلہ رحمی","1","51","1","51","शिष्टाचार, नेकी और संबंध निभाना","நல்லொழுக்கம், நேர்மை மற்றும் நல்லுறவு பேணுதல்","Akhlaq, Nekokari aur Silah Rehmi","Manieren, Rechtschaffenheit und Pflege guter Beziehungen","Modales, Rectitud y Mantenimiento de Buenas Relaciones"
"2","Morals and Asking Permission","الآداب والاستئذان","Morals and Asking Permission","Morals and Asking Permission","Morals and Asking Permission","Morals and Asking Permission","Morals and Asking Permission","Morals and Asking Permission","ادب اور اجازت طلب کرنے کا بیان","205","474","205","474","नैतिकता और अनुमति लेना","ஒழுக்கநெறிகள் மற்றும் அனுமதி கேட்டல்","Akhlaq aur Ijazat Talab Karna","Moral und um Erlaubnis bitten","Moral y Solicitud de Permiso"
"3","Adhan and Prayer","الأذان والصلاة","Adhan and Prayer","Adhan and Prayer","Adhan and Prayer","Adhan and Prayer","Adhan and Prayer","Adhan and Prayer","اذان اور نماز كا بیان","475","789","475","789","अज़ान और नमाज़","அதான் மற்றும் தொழுகை","Azan aur Namaz","Adhan und Gebet","Adhan y Oración"
